  "author": "KC桌面",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">花旗：AI推理前瞻-开源模型与智能飞轮，推理成本下降49%</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">8月25日，Vercel AI Gateway的token流量中，开放权重模型占比达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">53%</span>，比6月24日上升24个百分点。同期，前沿闭源与前沿开源模型之间的智能差距从9点收窄到3点。<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Citi</span>在最新一期AI基础设施追踪报告中，把这两组数字放在一起读：开源模型不再只是成本替代方案，而是正在成为开发者默认选择的一部分。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWBsDT08xur0QmV58MGibvkg37rrJngd3h8nTeAHibKaLiazvZyE5b3NUhwSQ95HxvibhbicfQQ13D0ElLQtbWLSkGricw3VGEOUrRcw/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUHXzJicMvOzgN3Se1jvJFhoyIsUicHZIHape6EBlRyOibbQhyfELBYyzPFiaNTywwHNmCDD1ZialiaibSia1vjJb02UEP3vnjUX3EYCJM/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUX2QAvyq9v7mjKia7VHlS4cCZeianWVlViaOmYSBfnWiaPCiagVmn5WICauaBUPdiaIB80I4yP5YqLaxBNvVO9eB99hyzwlK9icmJ5WE/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<section style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#737D8C;font-size:12px;line-height:1.75\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px\">——人工智能免责声明（部分内容由人工智能工具辅助生成）</p><p style=\"margin:0\">撰稿：Leo<br>责编：KC<br>排版：胡桃</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUsVdGOJsyDFZLDPkMuM5Wk8ZzuC4G1mibVPreUnSltpO04afUjfQBiaOlMiaRjkWTl8MCjH1zSZuC3WYtZZCFPmvgn4XwhdMjqEA/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC桌面\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 11-Citi-Artificial Intelligence Citi-s Inference Ahead - The Intelligence Flywheel-260831</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
